      "kind": "heading",
      "label": "Chapter 1",
      "title": "和 Paul 一家告别，Xanadu Farm"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "这两天住的农场，叫 <strong>Xanadu Farm</strong>。Paul 夫妇一路送我们到门口，我们说：下次带爸妈一起来住几天，他们说好啊。",
      "source_index": 30
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "/assets/maine-editorial/ME-14.jpg",
          "alt": "红谷仓前挂起奖牌"
        }
      ],
      "caption": "红谷仓前挂起奖牌｜摄影 / Siqi"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "/assets/maine-editorial/ME-15.jpg",
          "alt": "奖牌挂在小木屋旁"
        }
      ],
      "caption": "奖牌挂在小木屋旁"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "红色的谷仓，黄色的小屋，小屋外墙上还挂着我们这几天的奖牌，一串一串的，很好看。",
      "source_index": 30
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "/assets/maine-editorial/ME-17.jpg",
          "alt": "和 Paul 合影"
        }
